2. falcon-rust
   Author:   Alan Szepieniec
   Source:   https://github.com/aszepieniec/falcon-rust, v0.3.1 (commit 7a5ba9b)
   Licence:  MIT, reproduced below.
   Ported:
     - src/math.rs:68-216: babai_shifts and babai_reduce_bigint (the window schedule, the
       overshoot fallback and the stopping rule), on fixed-width limbs
                                                                     -> src/keygen/solve.rs,
                                                                        src/keygen/flat.rs
     - src/math.rs:1242-1303: the structure of ntru_solve            -> src/keygen/solve.rs
     - src/polynomial.rs:257-309: field_norm and lift_next_cyclotomic, as formulas
                                                                     -> src/keygen/bigpoly.rs,
                                                                        src/keygen/flat.rs
     - src/math.rs:1536-1568: gram_schmidt_norm_squared, as a formula -> src/keygen/gs.rs
   Not ported: xgcd. src/keygen/xgcd.rs implements Lehmer's extended gcd (Knuth, TAOCP vol. 2,
   section 4.5.2, Algorithm L).

